<dp:subject>Verify DeskPRO Login - New IP Address</dp:subject>

<html>
<head>
    {% include 'SendmailBundle:blocks:resources.html.twig' %}
</head>
<body>
{% include 'SendmailBundle:emails_common:email_code_top.html.twig' %}

{% include 'SendmailBundle:blocks:header.html.twig' %}

    <container>
        Someone has made a login attempt for your DeskPRO account from the following new IP address:<br/>
        {{ ip }}

        <br/><br/>

        If this is a valid login attempt by you, click the following link to validate the new IP address:<br />
        <a href="{{ url }}"/>{{ url }}</a>

        <br /><br />
        Once the IP address has been validated, you will be able to login to your account.

        <br/><br/>
        If you did not initiate this request; do not click the link above. Someone has successfully logged into your helpdesk account with your email address and password. You should contact your helpdesk administrator.
    </container>

{% include 'SendmailBundle:blocks:footer.html.twig' %}

{% include 'SendmailBundle:emails_common:email_code_bottom.html.twig' %}
</body>
</html>